37
00:05:09,399 --> 00:05:10,159
今夜 は 鳥 ? いや 瞬く 星 ?
Tonight, is it a bird? No, a twinkling star?

38
00:05:10,519 --> 00:05:11,139
夢の中 ホント に 輝く のに
Inside a dream, it really shines.

39
00:05:16,819 --> 00:05:17,309
時は誰も待ってくれないの
Time won't wait for anyone.

40
00:05:41,147 --> 00:05:41,887
無敵の笑顔で荒らすメディア
With an invincible smile, it stirs up the media.

41
00:05:43,777 --> 00:05:44,347
知りたいその秘密ミステリアス
I want to know that secret, it's mysterious.

42
00:05:46,117 --> 00:05:46,747
抜けてるところさえ彼女のエリア
Even that elusiveness is her area.

43
00:05:49,867 --> 00:05:50,607
完璧で嘘つきな君は
You, who are perfect and a liar,

44
00:05:52,497 --> 00:05:53,317
天才的なアイドル様
are a genius idol-sama!

45
00:05:58,127 --> 00:05:58,767
今日何食べた? 好きな本は?
What did you eat today? What's your favorite book?

46
00:06:01,137 --> 00:06:01,827
遊びに行くならどこに行くの?
If you go out to play, where do you go?

47
00:05:01,057 --> 00:06:04,617
何も食べてない それは内緒
I haven't eaten anything. That's a secret.

48
00:06:06,857 --> 00:06:07,427
何を聞かれてものらりくらり
Whatever is asked, I play it vaguely.

49
00:06:09,627 --> 00:06:10,167
そう淡々と だけど燦々と
So calmly, yet brilliantly.

50
00:06:12,407 --> 00:06:13,267
見えそうで見えない秘密は蜜の味
The secret that seems visible yet hidden is the taste of honey.

51
00:06:18,077 --> 00:06:18,927
好きなタイプは? 相手は? さあ答えて
What's your favorite type? Who's the partner? Come on, answer me.

52
00:06:21,377 --> 00:06:21,857
「誰かを好きになることなんて私分からなくてさ」
"Becoming fond of someone, I wouldn't even know."

53
00:06:26,977 --> 00:06:27,437
嘘か本当か知り得ない
You can't tell if it's a lie or the truth.

54
00:06:29,837 --> 00:06:30,527
そんな言葉にまた一人堕ちる
With such words, another person falls for it once more.

55
00:06:33,737 --> 00:06:34,347
また好きにさせる 誰もが目を奪われていく
Making them fall for you again, everyone has their gaze stolen.

56
00:06:39,067 --> 00:06:39,557
君は完璧で究極のアイドル
You are the perfect and ultimate idol.

57
00:06:41,887 --> 00:06:42,517
金輪際現れない 一番星の生まれ変わり
An unprecedented, reborn first star.

58
00:06:47,477 --> 00:06:48,347
あぁ、その笑顔で愛してるで
Ah, with that smile, saying "I love you,"

59
00:06:51,287 --> 00:06:51,697
誰も彼も虜にしていく
making everyone and that guy their prisoners.

60
00:06:54,207 --> 00:06:54,687
その瞳が その言葉が
That gaze, those words,

61
00:06:56,987 --> 00:06:57,667
嘘でもそれは完全なアイ
even if a lie, that is absolute love.

62
00:06:59,997 --> 00:07:00,687
はいはいあの子は特別です
Yes, yes, that girl is special.

63
00:07:02,597 --> 00:07:03,127
我々はハナからおまけです
We are out of the loop and just an extra.

64
00:07:05,297 --> 00:07:05,757
お星様の引き立て役Bです
We are supporting character B to the star.

65
00:07:07,977 --> 00:07:08,587
全てがあの子のお陰なわけない
Everything is thanks to that girl, no way.

66
00:07:10,977 --> 00:07:11,547
しゃらくさい 妬み嫉妬なんてないわけがない
There's no way jealousy doesn't exist.

67
00:07:15,557 --> 00:07:16,157
これこそ許せない 完璧じゃない君じゃ許せない
I can't forgive myself if it's not perfect.

68
00:07:19,017 --> 00:07:19,477
自分を許せない
I can't forgive myself.

69
00:07:19,967 --> 00:07:20,587
誰よりも強い 君以外は認めない
I won't acknowledge anyone stronger than you.

70
00:07:22,157 --> 00:07:22,577
誰もが信じ崇めてる
Everyone believes and worships you.

71
00:07:24,797 --> 00:07:25,307
まさに最強で無敵のアイドル
Truly the strongest, invincible idol.

72
00:07:28,547 --> 00:07:28,997
弱点なんて見当たらない
If any weakness is to be found,

73
00:07:30,927 --> 00:07:31,437
一番星を宿している
housing the first star.

74
00:07:33,577 --> 00:07:34,037
弱いとこなんて見せちゃダメダメ
Showing weaknesses must not be done.

75
00:07:36,447 --> 00:07:37,057
知りたくないところは見せずに
The parts people don't want to know shouldn't be shown.

76
00:07:39,477 --> 00:07:40,077
唯一無二じゃなくちゃイヤイヤ
It has to be one and only, no, no, no.

77
00:07:42,597 --> 00:07:43,097
それこそ本物のアイ
That's precisely the real ai.

78
00:07:46,137 --> 00:07:46,607
得意の笑顔で沸かすメディア
Stirring up the media with a triumphant smile.

79
00:07:48,817 --> 00:07:49,217
隠しきるこの秘密だけは
Only this secret can be kept hidden.

80
00:07:51,537 --> 00:07:52,087
愛してるって嘘で積むキャリア
A career built on lies saying "I love you."

81
00:07:55,237 --> 00:07:55,787
これこそ私なりの愛だ
This is my very own kind of love.

82
00:07:58,387 --> 00:07:58,907
流れる汗も綺麗なアクア
Flowing sweat is also a beautiful aqua.

83
00:08:01,637 --> 00:08:02,207
ルビーを隠したこの瞳影
This pupil hid a ruby.

84
00:08:04,617 --> 00:08:05,117
歌い踊り舞う私はマリア
Singing and dancing, I am Maria.

85
00:08:08,567 --> 00:08:09,127
そう嘘はとびきりの愛だ
Yes, lies are the greatest kind of love.

86
00:08:12,647 --> 00:08:13,267
誰かに愛されたことも
Being loved by someone,

87
00:08:15,557 --> 00:08:16,157
誰かのこと愛したことも
or having loved someone,

88
00:08:18,677 --> 00:08:19,477
ないそんな私の嘘がいつか本当になること
I have no such lies, but one day they will become the truth.

89
00:08:24,947 --> 00:08:25,607
信じてる いつかきっと全部手に入れる
I believe that someday I'll surely get everything.

90
00:08:29,367 --> 00:08:29,847
私はそう欲張りなアイドル
I am such a greedy idol.

91
00:08:32,207 --> 00:08:32,897
等身大でみんなのことちゃんと愛したいから
Because I want to properly love everyone down-to-earth,

92
00:08:37,807 --> 00:08:38,267
今日も嘘をつくの
today too, I tell a lie.

93
00:08:39,937 --> 00:08:40,417
この言葉がいつか本当に なる日を願って
Hoping for the day these words will truly become the truth.

94
00:08:45,317 --> 00:08:46,027
それでもまだ 君と君にだけは言えずにいたけど
Even so, I couldn't say it to you and you alone.

95
00:08:49,507 --> 00:08:50,057
あぁ、やっと言えた
Ah, I was finally able to say it.

96
00:08:51,857 --> 00:08:52,297
これは絶対嘘じゃない
This is definitely not a lie.

97
00:08:54,017 --> 00:08:54,357
愛してる
I love you.

98
00:10:10,516 --> 00:10:18,016
カナシイ 欲望に
