Like a boring flower petal,

308
00:33:30,275 --> 00:33:32,245
くるしみを忘れて
I forgot all my suffering,

309
00:33:36,625 --> 00:33:37,335
貴方の背中でそっと泣いて笑った
and smiled, softly crying on your shoulders.

310
00:33:41,385 --> 00:33:44,255
帰らぬ日々を思うような奇妙な愛しさに満ちた
I was filled with a curious sweetness,

311
00:33:50,095 --> 00:33:52,475
帰らぬ日々を思うような奇妙な愛しさに満ちた
the kind that makes you think of days that shan't ever come back.

312
00:34:01,865 --> 00:34:04,155
箱庭の中で息をひそめ
Holding my breath in a miniature garden,

313
00:34:11,245 --> 00:34:12,235
季節が行くことを忘れ静かな水底のような時間にいた
I stayed in a moment much like the quiet bottom of the sea,

314
00:34:17,425 --> 00:34:20,155
季節が行くことを忘れ静かな水底のような時間にいた
forgetting that seasons come and go.

315
00:34:33,325 --> 00:34:35,405
冷たい花びら夜に散り咲く
Cold flower petals scatter in the night,

316
00:34:39,165 --> 00:34:42,555
まるで白い雪のようだね切なく
they look just like white snow, don't they?

317
00:34:44,875 --> 00:34:47,435
貴方の上に降ったかなしみを全て
They fell above you, so bittersweet.

318
00:35:02,561 --> 00:35:07,551
私はきっと 許すことは出来ない
I'm sure I won't be able to forgive...

319
00:35:08,631 --> 00:35:14,711
優しい日々 涙が出るほど 帰りたい
I want to return to those gentle days so much, my eyes tear up...

320
00:35:15,071 --> 00:35:23,271
あなたと二人で 見上げた 花びらが散った
the flower petals we gazed at together have scattered.

321
00:35:33,211 --> 00:35:38,311
月が雲に隠れて
As the moon hides in the clouds...

322
00:35:39,171 --> 00:35:46,391
貴方は道を失くして 泣き出しそうな
you lose sight of your path, your eyes on the verge of tears.

323
00:35:51,411 --> 00:35:55,831
ざぎざぎなこころだって
Though our hearts have jagged edges...

324
00:35:56,941 --> 00:36:07,661
ふたつ合わせてみれば 優しいものがきっと
if we join them together, something tender will no doubt...

325
00:36:08,601 --> 00:36:13,281
生まれてくるわ
sprout to life.

326
00:36:14,221 --> 00:36:25,161
私を傷つけるものを 貴方は許さないでくれた
I will absolutely never allow anything that hurts you in any way.

327
00:36:26,371 --> 00:36:32,471
それだけでいいの
And that had been all I needed.

328
00:36:57,709 --> 00:37:01,429
戯れに伸ばされた あなたの手にしがみ付いた
When you playfully held out your hand, I clung to it.

329
00:37:08,439 --> 00:37:11,889
諦めていた世界に
I had given up all hope for this world...

330
00:37:14,189 --> 00:37:22,099
やがて温かな 灯がともる
until at last, a warm light kindled to life.

331
00:37:24,379 --> 00:37:29,039
冷たい花びら 夜を切り裂く
Icy flower petals cut through the night.

332
00:37:30,189 --> 00:37:40,459
私が摘んだ光をみんな束ねて 貴方の上に全部 よろこびのように まき散らしてあげたいだけ
I gather up in my hands all of the lights I plucked, only wishing I could scatter every one of them over you as if raining happiness on your shoulders...

333
00:37:47,439 --> 00:37:58,879
わるいことをしたらきっと貴方が 怒ってくれると約束したよね
If I ever did something bad, you promised that you would definitely be mad at me, right?

334
00:38:00,039 --> 00:38:06,929
だからききっともう一度 私を見つけてくれるよね
That's why, for sure, you'll come looking for me once more, won't you?

335
00:38:07,089 --> 00:38:12,839
寂しいところに もういなくていいね
I'd no longer have to be in this lonely place then.

336
00:38:13,969 --> 00:38:22,239
ひとりで見上げた 花びらが散った
The flower petals I gaze at on my own have scattered.

337
00:39:32,503 --> 00:39:35,403
Lyrics, Music: かいりきベア
Lyrics, Music: Kairiki Bear

338
00:39:43,823 --> 00:39:46,043
迷子迷子 まっただなかのさっさからパラノイア
Paranoia, paranoia, I'm at my wits' end!

339
00:39:48,943 --> 00:39:53,703
ドキドキマイコーこころてんてん パッパパラパラノイア
Heart pounding, heart pounding, all out of my mind, paranoia!

340
00:39:54,003 --> 00:39:58,813
タイトタイトたぷたぷからまっタッパパラパラノイア
Tired, tired, and all out of sorts, paranoia!

341
