sad sad 突っ伏して
Sad, sad, face down,

348
00:41:11,814 --> 00:41:13,314
ぱぱぱla ぱーらのーい「ど」
Pa-pa-pa-ra paranoid-oh!

349
00:41:13,414 --> 00:41:15,364
さあ ババ バグ さ バグバグ
It's bu-bu-bugging, bu-bu-bugging out!

350
00:41:15,364 --> 00:41:17,364
タタ タグ 才能 の タグ
Tag, tag, tagging, tag your talents now!

351
00:41:17,364 --> 00:41:19,064
もう ハハ 剥グ 感情 は 剥グ
More ha-ha-hallowed feelings, hallowed out,

352
00:41:19,064 --> 00:41:20,664
発症「クルシイ」は 嫌嫌嫌嫌嫌嫌
Hard to bear the "pain", not okay-okay-okay!

353
00:41:20,664 --> 00:41:22,464
まあ！絶叫 な 感情 下降 パッパ ラノーイ「ア」
Now! Watch all my feelings fall to Pa-paranoia!

354
00:41:22,464 --> 00:41:24,464
浸れ 声 上げ て は ぐぐる
I try to speak up, but we keep on spinning in place!

355
