沈め メミ メミ 嫌嫌嫌
I'm surely stuck on sinking, no way, no way, no way!

357
00:41:28,064 --> 00:41:29,564
さあ ババ バグ さ バグバグ
It's bu-bug-bugging! Bugging-bugging out!

358
