解答 絶え絶え 嫌嫌嫌嫌嫌嫌
The answer doesn't matter, I hate, I hate, I hate!

361
00:41:35,414 --> 00:41:37,614
くるくる ぱっかん系 法 待って 無理 ぐぐる せーの で まぜ
Snap, crack, warning! Wait, this isn't working for me!

362
00:41:48,564 --> 00:41:50,064
抱っこ 抱っこ いらない 子だ
Squeezing, squeeze me tight – and say I'm needed;

363
00:41:50,064 --> 00:41:51,664
パパパラ パーラ ノーイ「ア」
Pa-pa-pa-ra paranoia

364
00:41:51,664 --> 00:41:53,364
いい子 いい子「頑張れ」の 氾濫
Praising, praise me - who's the one to speak it?

365
00:41:53,364 --> 00:41:54,864
アドミニストレイター 呻吟
It's the one controlling us all Ahh!

366
00:41:54,864 --> 00:41:56,564
さあ ババ バグ さ バグバグ
Bu-bug-bugging! Bugging-bugging out!

367
00:41:56,564 --> 00:41:58,264
ララ ラグ ランタイムラグ
La-la-lagging, runtime lagging now

368
00:41:58,264 --> 00:41:59,864
ロロ ログ 反抗 の ログ
Lo-lo-logging, log in every shout

369
00:41:59,864 --> 00:42:01,864
ババ バグ ぱっぴぱらー パラノーイ「ア」
Bu-bu-bugging, pa–ppa–pa–la–pa; Pa-paranoia,

370
00:42:01,864 --> 00:42:03,564
パーラノーイ「ア」 パーラノーイ「ア」
Pa-paranoia, Pa-parano-i-no, no way, no way!!!

371
00:42:03,564 --> 00:42:05,564
さあ 全絶叫 な 感情 下降 パッパ ラノーイ「ア」
Now! Watch all my feelings fall to Pa-paranoia!

372
00:42:05,564 --> 00:42:07,464
左 右 行くえ も ぐるぐる 悲惨
No matter where I go, I'm left here spinning alone – oh no!

373
00:42:07,464 --> 00:42:09,564
限界脳 くまっちゃんちって やったラ滅多ラ
Brain about to break, I'm crazy no matter what say!!

374
00:42:09,564 --> 00:42:11,264
闇 まよえ よ よ いないいないばぁ いないいないばっ
I'm lost and drunk on darkness, Hey! Peek-a-boo!

375
00:42:11,264 --> 00:42:13,064
絶叫 な 感情 下降 パッパ ラノーイ「ア」
Watch all my feelings fall to Pa-paranoia!

376
00:42:13,064 --> 00:42:14,864
浸れ 声 上げ て は ぐぐる
I try to speak up, but we keep on spinning in place!

377
00:42:14,864 --> 00:42:16,564
まあ⚠️絶体絶命 下降 やったラ滅多ラ
Now! Watch me, I'm doomed to fall and won't ever get back up.

378
00:42:16,564 --> 00:42:18,264
焦がれ 枯れ 果て 嫌嫌嫌
Forever freezing feelings, no way, no way, no way!

379
00:42:18,264 --> 00:42:19,864
さあ ババ バグ さ バグバグ
It's bu-bug-bugging! Bugging-bugging out!

380
00:42:19,864 --> 00:42:21,564
爛々 爛々 爛々 無ラブ
The stinging from my beatings, I ache, I hate, I hate!

381
00:42:21,564 --> 00:42:23,064
ロロ ログ ハンコ の ログ
It's bu-bug-bugging! Bugging-bugging out!

382
00:42:23,064 --> 00:42:24,564
ババ バグ さ バグバグ
To date! To date! To date!

383
00:42:24,564 --> 00:42:26,564
耐え難い ねぇ
No way, no way, no way, no way, no way!

384
00:42:27,164 --> 00:42:29,064
イライライライナイナイボッテン
No way, no way, no way, no way, no way!

385
00:42:29,064 --> 00:42:31,064
絶叫 の 感情 下降 パッパ ラノーイ「ア」
Now! Watch all my feelings fall to Pa-paranoia!

386
00:42:31,064 --> 00:42:33,064
踊れ 遠く へ 上げ て は ぐぐる
Dancing far away, keeping on spinning in place!

387
00:42:33,064 --> 00:42:35,064
バグ バグ 絶え間 なく 揺るぐる
Bugs and bugs swaying without a break!

388
00:42:35,064 --> 00:42:38,064
沈め 痛い 限界 の 来る 調子 で やっと とらえ たらな
Finally catching on as my limit of pain approaches!

389
00:42:38,064 --> 00:42:40,064
呼び まい 迎え い ない い ない ばっ て ん
Calling and welcoming, peek-a-boo failure!

390
00:42:40,064 --> 00:42:42,064
絶叫 の 感情 下降 パッパ ラノーイ「ア」
Now! Watch all my feelings fall to Pa-paranoia!

391
00:42:42,064 --> 00:42:42,564
浸れ と 上げ たわ ぐるぐる
Immersing and raising voices, spinning around!

392
00:42:42,564 --> 00:42:44,064
まーじーでーせーじーめーらーかーやってらめったら
Seriously, in a hopeless mess, over and over!

393
00:42:44,064 --> 00:42:46,064
ここ へ 辿り着い て イライライライア
Arriving here, irritated and frustrated!

394
00:42:46,064 --> 00:42:48,064
さあ バババグ さバグバグ
It's bu-bug-bugging! Bugging-bugging out!

395
00:42:48,064 --> 00:42:50,064
ラララグ ランタイムラグ
La-la-lagging, runtime lagging now

396
00:42:50,064 --> 00:42:52,064
ロロログ ハンコのログ
Lo-lo-logging, log in every shout

397
00:42:52,064 --> 00:42:54,064
バババグ さバグバグ
Bu-bu-bugging, bu-bug-bugging out!

398
00:42:54,064 --> 00:42:56,064
イライライラナイナイバー
No way, no way, no way, no way, no way!

399
00:42:56,064 --> 00:42:58,064
イライライラナイナイバー
No way, no way, no way, no way, no way!

400
00:43:17,564 --> 00:43:20,314
いつだって君は嫌われ者だ
You're always someone who gets laughed at

401
00:43:20,314 --> 00:43:22,564
やる事為す事ツイてなくて
Whatever you do, it never goes well in the end

402
00:43:22,564 --> 00:43:26,564
挙句に雨に降られて
It's all washed away by the rain

403
00:43:27,264 --> 00:43:30,264
お気に入りの傘は風で飛んでって
You say your favorite umbrella has been sent flying away by the wind

404
00:43:30,264 --> 00:43:36,864
そこのノラはご苦労様と足を跨づけてった
That stray over there, it did a great job stepping all over you, as always

405
00:43:47,364 --> 00:43:50,164
いつもどおり君は嫌われ者だ
You're someone who's been hated, without any reason even

406
00:43:50,164 --> 00:43:53,064
なんみせすとも遠ざけられて
People keep their distance from you

407
00:43:53,064 --> 00:43:56,564
努力をしてみるけど
But you try giving it your best

408
00:43:56,564 --> 00:44:00,564
その理由なんて「なんとなく?」で
There has to be a reason, "for no reason at all?"

409
00:44:00,564 --> 00:44:05,264
君は途方にくれて悲しんでた
You think you're at a loss and you've become sad

410
00:44:06,864 --> 00:44:09,564
ならあたしの声を使えばいいよ
If that's the case you should use my voice

411
00:44:09,564 --> 00:44:16,564
人によっては理解不能でなんて耳障りひどい声だって言われるけど
That's impossible to understand by people / "How annoying to the ear, how cruel the voice is"

412
00:44:16,564 --> 00:44:19,064
きっと君の力になれる
It can surely become your strength

413
00:44:19,064 --> 00:44:22,064
だからあたしを歌わせてみて
So try making me sing

414
00:44:22,064 --> 00:44:26,864
そう君の 君だけの言葉でさ
Yeah, with your words, and your words alone

415
00:44:31,264 --> 00:44:35,064
綴って 連ねて
Compose them, and bring them together

416
00:44:35,064 --> 00:44:39,564
あたしがその思想を叫ぶから
Because I'll be singing those words

417
00:44:41,864 --> 00:44:46,564
描いて 理想を
Paint out your ideals

418
00:44:46,564 --> 00:44:51,564
その想いは誰にも触れさせない
I won't let anyone touch those feelings

419
00:44:51,564 --> 00:44:56,564
ガラクタの声はそして響く
And then the voice of the odds and ends resounds

420
00:44:56,564 --> 00:44:59,964
ありのままを不器用に繋いで 目一杯に
Unskillfully bringing together the truth / With all your might...

421
00:45:00,195 --> 00:45:01,872
大声を上げる
Raising my voice at the top of my lungs,

422
00:45:02,205 --> 00:45:05,975
いつからか君は人気者だ
ever since, you became popular,

423
00:45:06,095 --> 00:45:11,825
たくさんの人に持て囃され あたしも鼻が高い
idolized by so many, and I too held my head up high.

424
00:45:12,425 --> 00:45:15,725
でもいつからか君は変わった
But one day, you changed.

425
00:45:16,215 --> 00:45:20,055
冷たくなって だけど寂しそうだった
You became cold, yet you seemed so lonely.

426
00:45:22,065 --> 00:45:26,405
「もう機械の声なんてたくさんだ 僕は僕自身なんだよって」
"I've had enough of mechanical voices! I am who I am!"

427
00:45:26,955 --> 00:45:31,835
ついに君は抑えきれなくなって あたしを嫌った
Finally, you couldn't hold it back anymore and came to hate me.

428
00:45:32,485 --> 00:45:36,705
君の後ろで誰かが言う 虎の威を借るキツネの癖に！
Behind you, someone says, "Using others' power like a fox hiding behind a tiger!"

429
00:45:37,105 --> 00:45:41,945
ねえ 君は 一人で泣いてたんだね
Hey... you were crying all alone, weren't you?

430
00:45:46,435 --> 00:45:49,345
聴こえる？この声
Can you hear this voice?

431
00:45:49,595 --> 00:45:55,845
あたしがその誹謗をかき消すから
I'll drown out all those slanderous words.

432
00:46:00,605 --> 00:46:05,485
わかってるときた 本当は君が誰より優しいってことを
I know... deep down, you're kinder than anyone else.

433
00:46:06,925 --> 00:46:11,905
ガラクタの声はそして歌った 他の誰でもない君のために
Then the voice of the odds and ends sang, for you, and no one else.

434
00:46:12,175 --> 00:46:16,035
軋んでく 限界を超えて
Creaking past the limits,

435
00:46:17,135 --> 00:46:21,505
二人はどんなにたくさんの言葉を思いついたことだろう
how many words must the two of us have thought of?

436
00:46:21,875 --> 00:46:27,605
だけど今は何ひとつ思いつかなくて だけど何もかもわかった
But now, not a single word comes to mind, yet we understood everything.

437
00:46:27,945 --> 00:46:37,455
「そうか、きっこれは夢だ。永遠に醒めない、君と会えた、そんな夢」
"Ah, I see... this must be a dream. An endless dream where I got to meet you."

438
00:46:41,555 --> 00:46:45,785
ガラクタは幸せそうな表情をしたまま
The odds and ends remained with a happy expression,

439
00:46:46,495 --> 00:46:50,625
どれだけ呼んでももう動かない
no matter how much you call out, it won't move anymore.

440
00:46:51,425 --> 00:46:56,355
望んだはずの結末に君は泣き叫ぶ
At the very ending you wished for, you cry and shout,

441
00:46:56,955 --> 00:47:01,145
嘘だろ嘘だろってそう泣き叫ぶ
crying and screaming, "It's a lie, it has to be a lie!"

442
00:47:07,205 --> 00:47:16,005
「僕は無力だ ガラクタひとつだって救えやしない」
"I am powerless... I couldn't even save a single piece of junk."

443
00:47:17,415 --> 00:47:26,225
想いは涙にぽつりぽつりとその頬を濡らす
Feelings wet those cheeks drop by drop as tears.

444
00:47:27,125 --> 00:47:36,505
その時世界は途端にその色を大きく変える
At that moment, the world drastically changes its colors.

445
00:47:36,955 --> 00:47:46,465
ああ、悲しみ喜び全てをひとりとはひとつは知った
Ah, knowing sadness and joy, knowing that everything is connected as one...

446
00:47:47,085 --> 00:47:51,645
言葉は歌になりこの世界を再び駆け巡る君のために
Words become a song, traveling across this world once more, for your sake.

447
00:47:52,095 --> 00:48:00,245
その声に意志を宿して今想いが響く
Infusing that voice with intent, our feelings now resound.

448
00:48:54,475 --> 00:48:59,145
さあ 散らばってしまった話を
Now, let's pick up the scattered stories...

449
00:49:01,955 --> 00:49:07,205
空に手を伸ばし始める
and begin stretching our hands to the sky.

450
00:49:09,195 --> 00:49:16,965
下を通り過ぎる曲がった線に
To the crooked lines passing underneath,

451
00:49:17,455 --> 00:49:22,325
縛られた足をくすぐるの
tickling our bound feet...

452
00:49:24,255 --> 00:49:31,005
嗚呼、落ちて汚れた意識を
Ah, taking fallen and tainted consciousness,

453
00:49:32,255 --> 00:49:36,955
名前と呪術にかけて
casting it into names and sorcery.

454
00:49:39,885 --> 00:49:46,565
空っぽだった体の
Of a body that was once empty,

455
00:49:48,405 --> 00:49:52,865
夢見ていたまぶたが開く
the eyelids I dreamed of are opening.

456
00:49:55,295 --> 00:50:00,055
心の奥からうごめく記憶
Memories stirring deep within the heart.

457
00:50:00,402 --> 00:50:01,602
心の奥から
From the depths of my heart,

458
00:50:02,122 --> 00:50:05,222
混じった呪いと祝福が
mixed curses and blessings

459
00:50:05,982 --> 00:50:08,642
目の前を
before my eyes...

460
00:50:09,212 --> 00:50:10,102
知ってるの？
Do you know?

461
00:50:10,202 --> 00:50:16,562
始まりと終わりに向かって
Heading toward the beginning and the end,

462
00:50:17,142 --> 00:50:24,562
果てに、帰ってくるのはパパの呼び声だけ
in the end, what returns is only my father's call.

463
00:50:25,542 --> 00:50:32,562
鳴呼、パパ、そこに居たら教えて欲しいの
Ah, Papa, if you are there, I want you to tell me—

464
00:50:33,302 --> 00:50:42,062
私が歩くこの道はどんな色だろう
what color is this path I walk upon?

465
00:50:52,562 --> 00:50:58,342
さぁ、この調べの旋律を
Now, the melody of this tune—

466
00:50:59,962 --> 00:51:05,902
空に手を伸ばし始める
I begin reaching my hands up to the sky.

467
00:51:07,202 --> 00:51:13,962
散りばめられた 遠くの血のイチイラ
Scattered blood of the distant ones...

468
00:51:17,180 --> 00:51:21,880
愛を隠して泣き叫んでる
hiding love and crying out.

469
00:52:00,880 --> 00:52:06,680
始まりと終わりに向かって
Heading toward the beginning and the end,

470
00:52:07,180 --> 00:52:15,580
果てに、帰ってくるのは救われなかった君の声
in the end, what returns is the voice of you who could not be saved.

471
00:52:16,380 --> 00:52:22,880
愛しい妹よ、そこに居たら教えて
My dear younger sister, if you are there, tell me—

472
00:52:23,280 --> 00:52:33,480
君の手をいつまでも握れるのかな
will I ever be able to hold your hand again?

